# Agent tools for this repo

## Prefer these MCPs

| Need | Tool |
|------|------|
| Up-to-date library docs (Next, Django, Tailwind, DRF, shadcn) | **Context7** |
| Automated browser / E2E checks | **Playwright** |
| Quick UI inspect / click-through in Cursor | **Browser** (built-in) |
| Design → code from Figma frames | **Figma** MCP (user/global) |
| Hit real HTTP APIs / collections | **Postman** MCP (after auth) |
| Git / PR / issues | **GitLens / GitHub** MCP |

## UI guidance

- New UI: `@/components/ui` (shadcn). Theme = kiosk orange/cream CSS variables
- After UI changes, verify with Browser or Playwright when a server is running

## Guidance

- Do not enable every MCP for every task — pick 1–2 relevant tools
- Never print or commit API keys, tokens, or `.env` values
- Prefer reading existing `lib/api` and Django urls/serializers before calling external APIs
